{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2021-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1613952000, "end_date": 1614556799, "month_true_total": 106, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:59:52 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "87632936", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033715204", "personaname": "mummypappa66", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198033715204/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 959, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 949, "last_played": 1654793557, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "SSpeiish Maariiiinssh", "timestamp_created": 1614547164, "timestamp_updated": 1614547164, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87625626", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003229200", "personaname": "Pikathulhu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198003229200/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 65, "playtime_forever": 761, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 761, "last_played": 1614537122, "avatar": "9e9cc91d4ce5d7b2c4d1b5fd9df3ab611a791ee6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Admittedly this is a low bar, but Space Marine is one of the best 40K games ever made. The combat is simple but the variety of weapons you obtain throughout the ~8 hour campaign keep things fresh. Stomping on Ork skulls never gets old, and sequences with the jetpack and Thunder Hammer are particular highlights.\nThe atmosphere created by the visuals and audio definitely are very 40K. There's clearly a lot of love for the source material on display.\n\nUnfortunately, the story ends on a cliffhanger as two sequels were planned but never made. (Thanks, THQ!)\nThe best part of this game was the multiplayer, which years after release is essentially dead. That said, there are groups out there that put together multiplayer events to this day. If you are interested they shouldn't be too hard to find.\n\nIf this game is on sale, it's definitely worth a buy!", "timestamp_created": 1614538270, "timestamp_updated": 1614538270, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87577087", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007092477", "personaname": "Hexidecimark", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hexidecimark/", "num_games_owned": 268, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 569, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 236, "last_played": 1650684709, "avatar": "d32c5755e3f1d1a6ed95a2521d7fda1e7e0e226c"}, "language": "english", "review": "(played more on PS3)\n\nGame's pretty great and is basically two separate games given the stark contrast between the doom-2016-like singleplayer and the more call of duty structured multiplayer. \n\nMulti's fairly dead now but bring your friends and it's a grand time.", "timestamp_created": 1614474582, "timestamp_updated": 1614474582, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87570815", "author": {"steamid": "76561198278020954", "personaname": "Flibbernodgets", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198278020954/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 1745, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1258, "last_played": 1726254535, "avatar": "3f6e22ee890ff915b5a822fb845e1c51f316d28b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Despite the many many Warhammer 40K titles that exist, a lot of them are not very good. This game is widely considered one of the best on offer. It's good, mindless, hack/slash/shooting fun of which I wish there was more, and if that sounds fun then pick it up on sale. Be warned, if you do like this game playing it may result in a deep feeling of melancholy for the studio that collapsed before it could make a sequel, and for another dying game called Dark Crusade which is the closest thing to Space Marine's multiplayer mode.", "timestamp_created": 1614465273, "timestamp_updated": 1614465273, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87501002", "author": {"steamid": "76561198947152917", "personaname": "Hemorojdrage", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198947152917/", "num_games_owned": 142, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 1074, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 226, "last_played": 1681055232, "avatar": "0864f617dab85f1a607d1dcd2292dc8ff54bf189"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is awesome because it is. The character you start as is very ugly but som mods can give him new armour or a new helmet. You should try it out when you can.", "timestamp_created": 1614372903, "timestamp_updated": 1614372903, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.445498883724212646", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}